OL,3,AOrangutans released back into Borneo
OL,4,Aforest after devastating fires
OL,5,
OL,6,FEight orangutans have been released
OL,7,Fback into the wild in Borneo after they
OL,8,Fwere taken into captivity when their
OL,9,Fhabitat was threatened by wildfires
OL,10,Fover the summer.
OL,12,FThree mothers, their three daughters
OL,13,Fand two adult males were freed in a
OL,14,Freserve in the west of the island on
OL,15,FFriday, International Animal Rescue
OL,16,FIndonesia (Yiari) and the forestry
OL,17,Fministry said.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
