OL,3,AOrangutans released back into Borneo
OL,4,Aforest after devastating fires
OL,5,
OL,6,FIndonesian authorities rescued 46
OL,7,Forangutans from fires in August and
OL,8,FSeptember. Wildfires in the region are
OL,9,Fusual for the country's dry season but
OL,10,Fintensified this year.
OL,12,FThe apes are critically endangered.
OL,13,FAround 104,000 orangutans remain in
OL,14,FBorneo and Sumatra, down from more than
OL,15,F230,000 a century ago, according to
OL,16,Fconservation group WWF.
